This file exists so that automated licence detection has a single conventional
name to find. The two files it points at are the actual licence texts; if they
ever disagree with this summary, they win.

The typeface vendored under docs-site/assets/fonts/ is Noctua Iosevka, a custom
build of Iosevka by Renzhi Li, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its licence
travels with it, in docs-site/assets/fonts/OFL.md, and applies to those files
rather than to this project.
